tive for CD56 (400&#215;).</p></caption><graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" position="float" orientation="portrait" xlink:href="amjcaserep-19-1437-g006.jpg"/></fig></floats-group></article></pmc-articleset>